i-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea2f0556099a403a\" href=\"?note=ea2f0556099a403a\" title=\"67-df-partial-truth-definition\">67-df-partial-truth-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e6c8c75d056b765\" href=\"?note=0e6c8c75d056b765\" title=\"67-df-compositional-partial-truth\">67-df-compositional-partial-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"uniform reflection RFN_S"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"52,61"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63,72"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 固定有效呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T\">\\(E_T\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的标准证明公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a>，全部对象使用同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,D,\\gamma\">\\(g,D,\\gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0e6c8c75d056b765\" href=\"?note=0e6c8c75d056b765\" title=\"67-df-compositional-partial-truth\">67-df-compositional-partial-truth</a> 的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,c,r,b\">\\(U,c,r,b\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{\\varepsilon,n}\">\\(c_{\\varepsilon,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\varepsilon,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\varepsilon,n}\\)</span> 均由该文件的 Assertion 构造，不再调用未提供的“原书同一构造”。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon&lt;2\">\\(\\varepsilon&lt;2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n\\)</span>。以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm R_{\\Sigma_n}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm R_{\\Sigma_n}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm R_{\\Pi_n}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm R_{\\Pi_n}(T)\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm R_{0,n}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm R_{0,n}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm R_{1,n}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm R_{1,n}(T)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall z\\bigl(c_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_T(z)\\to\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm R_{\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{URefl}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T):\\varepsilon&lt;2\\land n\\ge1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall z\\bigl(c_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_T(z)\\to\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm R_{\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{URefl}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T):\\varepsilon&lt;2\\land n\\ge1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留每个复杂度类给一个代码量化反思句的原定义形式，不把它与参数化反思实例集认作同一语法集合。定义和相关命题现在相对于已明列全部条件的本册部分真参数，而不是未提供的外部文本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partial-truth-definition","status":"resolved","id":"ea2f0556099a403a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partial-truth-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-compositional-partial-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-compositional-partial-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-representation]]","embed":false},{"target"