and\\mathrm{Prov}_T(z)\\to\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\varepsilon,n}(z)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm R_{\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}}(T)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{URefl}(T)&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm R_{\\varepsilon,n}(T):\\varepsilon<2\\land n\\ge1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2392,"backlinks":[{"id":"62d61040ca5b337c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"此片段名是本册的整理记号；原书第 52 页并未把它作为独立定义。源书实际的 RFN 见 [[67-df-uniform-reflection]]。"},{"id":"25293634b979c36f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书第 52 页实际定义的是按复杂度类的代码／部分真定义反思；第 61 页注释明确提醒该 RFN 与通常称作 uniform reflection 的版本不完全一样，在含 PA 的理论中差别可忽略。因此本条注明是通常版本的形式展开，原书的实际代码版本另见 [[67-df-uniform-reflection]]；不把两套句子集合宣称逐字相等。"},{"id":"8dd4150b375026b2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{URefl}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-uniform-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)$ 取 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。$X$ 可为非递归可枚举句子集。"},{"id":"5626944c4bb4a9d5","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)$、$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)$、$R_\\omega(T)$、$\\mathrm{URefl}(T)$ 分别取 [[67-df-iterated-consistency]]、[[67-df-local-reflection]]、[[67-df-iterated-local-reflection]]、[[67-df-uniform-reflection]]。"},{"id":"0507b673d2cc3959","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{URefl}(T)$ 使用 [[67-df-uniform-reflection]] 的 $\\mathrm{CPT}(U)$、$\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)$ 参数；$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)$ 取 [[67-df-local-reflection]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-uniform-reflection]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-uniform-reflection]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-uniform-reflection]]；[[../67-thm-reflection-principle]]；[[../67-thm-reflection-hierarchy]]；[[../67